<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= quiz.title %> | Studix01.net</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="navbar container">
      <a href="/" class="logo">📚 Studix01</a>
      <ul class="nav-links">
        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="/quizzes">Quizzes</a></li>
        <li><a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a></li>
      </ul>
      <button id="theme-toggle" class="theme-toggle">🌙</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="section">
      <div class="card">
        <h1><%= quiz.title %></h1>
        <p class="text-muted"><%= quiz.subject %> • <%= quiz.questions %> questions • <%= quiz.timeLimit %> minutes</p>

        <div class="quiz-form" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
          <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
            <p>1. Which of the following is a key concept in this subject?</p>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="a"> A. Application</label><br>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="b"> B. Review</label><br>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="c"> C. Practice</label><br>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q1" value="d"> D. Analysis</label>
          </div>

          <div class="card" style="margin-bottom: 1rem;">
            <p>2. What is the best way to improve understanding?</p>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="a"> A. Read and revise consistently</label><br>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="b"> B. Ignore the syllabus</label><br>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="c"> C. Skip exercises</label><br>
            <label><input type="radio" name="q2" value="d"> D. Memorize without checking</label>
          </div>

          <input type="hidden" id="quiz-id" value="<%= quiz.id %>">
          <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="submitQuiz()">Submit Quiz</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="footer-bottom container">
      <p>© 2024 Studix01.net</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
  <script src="/js/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>























